@startuml
title Real-time updates

actor "Device A" as A
actor "Device B" as B
participant "API Gateway\nWebSocket API" as WS
participant "Connect Lambda" as Connect
database "Connections table\n(TTL)" as Table
participant "Express API\n(Web Function)" as Api

B -> WS : wss://...?token=<access token>
WS -> Connect : $connect
Connect -> Connect : verify Cognito token
Connect -> Table : save (ownerId, connectionId)
Connect --> WS : 200
WS --> B : connected, B syncs once

A -> Api : POST/PATCH/PUT/DELETE (Bearer token)
Api -> Api : handle the write
Api -> Table : list connections of owner
Api -> WS : PostToConnection {"type":"changed"}
WS --> B : {"type":"changed"}
B -> Api : push outbox, pull changes
Api --> A : response

note over Api, Table
Gone connections (410) are deleted by the notifier.
Failures never fail the request.
end note
@enduml
